    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d389">

                <pb facs="0502" n="422" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg422"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Emperor William to President Roosevelt</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-01-10"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Most gratified at your kind permission for Miss Roosevelt’s performing
                    christening ceremony at launch of my yacht. It gives me great pleasure to
                    announce to you that I have ordered my yacht <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hohenzollern</hi> to cross over and to be present at the ceremony. My
                    brother, Admiral Prince Henry of Prussia, will appear as my representative,
                    rejoin the yacht, and will be able to express to you once more my sincere
                    feelings of friendship for the United States and their illustrious head.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William II</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
